{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330350/extras/WhoWon-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744457653\" />\u00a0An new approach to representing Athletics and Track mechanics in gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete against other sprinters in different modes and tournaments to fill your trophy cabinet and unlock new gear .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple modes are available to the player:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new Training ground mode help new comers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Time Trial Mode to challenge players and unlock reward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick races can be done in single player or with local 2 player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hermes Quest:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just like the Greek god himself , participate at this new original tournament with a created sprinter and strive for Gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Locations, both indoors and outdoors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Race Types ranging from the 60 meters to the 400 meters relay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3330350?t=1744457653","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744457653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330350/3fc3ae74e0ccf1e37c2b35e35a103cc0dcb39752/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744457653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330350/3fc3ae74e0ccf1e37c2b35e35a10